Oracle integration test for the Gnutella engine.

Test: TestGTK_GnutellaOracle (oracle_gtkgnutella_test.go)

Required oracle: gtk-gnutella (Gnutella 0.6 servent), e.g. 1.3.x.
Environment:
  GTK_GNUTELLA_BIN=/path/to/gtk-gnutella  (must be executable)

The test is skipped loudly when this variable is unset or not executable.

The test starts gtk-gnutella in --topless mode with an isolated
GTK_GNUTELLA_DIR (temp config/share dir), seeds a small file named
sharzaoracle.bin, and connects a gnutella.Engine to it over loopback
(127.0.0.1:6346). It searches for "sharzaoracle", fetches the hit via
Downloader.Fetch, and asserts byte-for-byte equality with the seed.

Config generated by the test (config_gnet):
  listen_port = 6346
  shared_dirs_paths = <temp share dir>
  scan_extensions = --all--
  online_mode = 0
  max_ultrapeers = 0
  max_connections = 8

No public swarm is contacted.
